    "body": "<!-- stage-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://stagereview.app/marmot-protocol/whitenoise-rs/pull/846\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-dark.svg\">\n    <img src=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-light.svg\" alt=\"Open in Stage\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-end -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Release Notes\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Messages from blocked users are now automatically filtered and marked as blocked in the app\n  * Push notifications are suppressed for blocked authors\n  * Search results exclude messages from blocked contacts\n  * Improved mute list synchronization at app startup\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed unread count and message preview behavior for direct messages with blocked contacts\n  * Corrected message ordering when timestamps are identical\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/marmot-protocol/whitenoise-rs/pull/846?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
